{%- comment -%}
  The line that has to appear anywhere we talk about cooling.

  A cooling bed changes the surface a dog lies on. It does not replace shade,
  water or a sensible decision about the car, and saying so is both the honest
  position and the one that keeps the claim defensible.

  Usage: {% render 'pl-cool-note' %}  or with class: 'cool-note--dark'
{%- endcomment -%}
<p class="cool-note {{ class }}">
  {% render 'pl-icon', icon: 'shield', size: 16 %}
  <span>{{ text | default: 'Cooling beds keep the surface your dog lies on cooler than the floor. They are not a substitute for shade, fresh water, or keeping a dog out of a hot car.' }}</span>
</p>
